            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- New app icon

### Bug Fixes
- "Check for Updates" no longer skips a release. The appcast was signing a rebuilt copy of the DMG while a different file was published, so Sparkle failed the signature check and silently discarded the update, offering an older version as the latest.
]]></description>
