        <item>
            <title>2.28.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 10:51:12 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>111</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.28.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features

- **Sessions now stream to Canopy Mobile.** A session sends what it is doing as it happens — the assistant's messages, the turns you type, and a one-line summary of each tool call — so the phone shows the conversation instead of only the completion and permission-request notifications it got before. Canopy's own synthetic turns (the hourly keep-alive and the recap) and a subagent's traffic are deliberately excluded, so the phone shows this conversation and nothing else.
]]></description>
